# Get Out, second mode: "Return one or two target creatures and/or enchantments you own to your hand." Bot1 owns two Ornithopters (creatures) and a Fastbond (an enchantment); Bot2 has a
# Llanowar Elves (a creature it owns, not Bot1's) and a Sol Ring (neither a creature nor an enchantment). The Elves and the Sol Ring cannot be targeted, nor can no target, nor three
# (the refusals); an Ornithopter and the Fastbond are chosen together (the positive control) and both return to Bot1's hand, while the other Ornithopter and Bot2's permanents stay.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Fastbond
Get Out
Mox Sapphire
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Sol Ring
Forest x16

